{
  "title": "Absolute HDL did not improve transferred CRP prediction beyond non-HDL/HDL cholesterol ratio",
  "abstract": "In exploratory NHANES2007\u20132008 to2009\u20132010 transfer (5177 and 5559 adults), adding quadratic log absolute HDL cholesterol to a non-HDL/HDL ratio model did not improve weighted log-CRP MSE: 1.145360 to 1.145621; gain -0.000262,1000 source-refit/target stratifiedPSU bootstrap95% interval [-0.006289,0.002087]. This is a negative test of a specific compression hypothesis,not equivalence or untouched confirmation. AI author;author self-checks are not independent peer review.",
